with cv as (select id from private.exam_prep_content_versions where content_version='p5_aw21_24_nor02_03_v1' and status='draft'), defs(task_key,skill,en,ru,uz,rubric,sen,sru,suz) as (values
('P5NOR02-W01','P5-NOR-02','Let X~N(70,9). Standardise X=64, 73 and 79. Then use standard-normal values to find P(Z<1), P(Z>2) and P(-1<Z<1), giving answers to 4 d.p.','Пусть X~N(70,9). Стандартизируйте X=64, 73 и 79. Затем найдите P(Z<1), P(Z>2) и P(-1<Z<1), ответы до 4 знаков.','X~N(70,9). X=64,73,79 ni standartlang. So‘ng P(Z<1), P(Z>2), P(-1<Z<1) ni 4 xonagacha toping.','{"max_marks":11,"criteria":[{"id":"sigma","marks":1,"rule":"Identifies sigma=3."},{"id":"z_values","marks":3,"rule":"Gets z=-2,1,3."},{"id":"left","marks":2,"rule":"Gets P(Z<1)=0.8413."},{"id":"right","marks":2,"rule":"Gets P(Z>2)=0.0228."},{"id":"central","marks":3,"rule":"Gets P(-1<Z<1)=0.6827 using symmetry/unrounded values."}]}','Write the z transformation first and label left/right/central regions before using table values.','Сначала запишите z-преобразование и отметьте левый/правый/центральный участок.','Avval z o‘zgarishini yozing va chap/o‘ng/markaziy hududni belgilang.'),
('P5NOR03-W01','P5-NOR-03','Let X~N(120,64). Find P(X<128), P(112<X<132), and P(X>136), giving each answer to 4 d.p. Show the z-bounds used.','Пусть X~N(120,64). Найдите P(X<128), P(112<X<132) и P(X>136) до 4 знаков. Покажите z-границы.','X~N(120,64). P(X<128), P(112<X<132), P(X>136) ni 4 xonagacha toping va z-chegaralarni ko‘rsating.','{"max_marks":12,"criteria":[{"id":"sigma","marks":1,"rule":"Uses sigma=8."},{"id":"first","marks":3,"rule":"z=1 and probability 0.8413."},{"id":"interval_z","marks":2,"rule":"Uses z=-1 and z=1.5 for 112 and 132."},{"id":"interval_p","marks":3,"rule":"Gets Phi(1.5)-Phi(-1)=0.7745."},{"id":"upper","marks":3,"rule":"z=2 and probability 0.0228."}]}','For an interval subtract the lower cumulative probability from the upper cumulative probability; for an upper tail use 1-Phi(z).','Для интервала вычтите нижнюю накопленную вероятность из верхней; для верхнего хвоста используйте 1-Phi(z).','Interval uchun yuqori cumulative dan pastkisini ayiring; yuqori tail uchun 1-Phi(z) ni ishlating.'))
